WEBVTT

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:50.432
☆Welcome to the Grandville Art Museum. This is the main entrance. To the left of the entrance is the board that shows the schedule of guided tours. If you would like to join one of our tours, please go to the gift shop and let the staff know. You can get a ticket for the tour there. The guided tours are very popular, so please get your ticket early.
